<div>
  <p>Run the {% pluginLink %} from your app's folder:</p>
  <pre><code>./mvnw com.okta:okta-maven-plugin:register</code></pre>
  <p>Answer a few questions (name, email, and company), and it will generate a new Okta developer account for you. If you already have an Okta account registered, use login instead of register.</p>
  <p>Then, configure your Spring Boot application to use Okta for authentication:</p>
  <pre><code>./mvnw com.okta:okta-maven-plugin:spring-boot</code></pre>
  <p>This will set up a new OIDC application for you and write your Okta settings to your src/main/resources/application.properties file.</p>
  <p><span>NOTE:</span> You can also use the Okta Admin Console to create your app. See {{ docsLink }} for more information.</p>
</div>
